					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="1568" height="964" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Black-Friday-2026-Deals-Sales-Promotions-GWP-Gift-with-Purchases-Banner-Logo-Insiders-Rewards-Center.jpg" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="LEGO Black Friday 2026 Deals, Sales, Promotions, GWP Gift with Purchases Banner Logo Insiders Rewards Center" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Black-Friday-2026-Deals-Sales-Promotions-GWP-Gift-with-Purchases-Banner-Logo-Insiders-Rewards-Center.jpg 1568w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Black-Friday-2026-Deals-Sales-Promotions-GWP-Gift-with-Purchases-Banner-Logo-Insiders-Rewards-Center-300x184.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Black-Friday-2026-Deals-Sales-Promotions-GWP-Gift-with-Purchases-Banner-Logo-Insiders-Rewards-Center-1024x630.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Black-Friday-2026-Deals-Sales-Promotions-GWP-Gift-with-Purchases-Banner-Logo-Insiders-Rewards-Center-768x472.jpg 768w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Black-Friday-2026-Deals-Sales-Promotions-GWP-Gift-with-Purchases-Banner-Logo-Insiders-Rewards-Center-1536x944.jpg 1536w" sizes="(max-width: 1568px) 100vw, 1568px" loading="lazy" /></p>
<p>LEGO Black Friday 2026 Promotions, Sales &#38; GWP Gift with Purchases will be happening at LEGO (USA &#124; Canada &#124; UK &#124; Australia). In</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-black-friday-2026-sale-promotions-gwp-ideas-godzilla-release-more-november-27-29-2026/">LEGO Black Friday 2026 Sale, Promotions, GWP, IDEAS Godzilla Release &#038; More: November 27-29, 2026</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>LEGO Black Friday 2026 Promotions, Sales &amp; GWP Gift with Purchases will be happening at LEGO (<a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a>). In addition, the brand-new 18+ LEGO IDEAS 21375 Godzilla set will be releasing on Black Friday, November 27, 2026 as well. Below is a rundown of everything happening for LEGO Black Friday 2026. Its best that you have an Insiders Rewards Account (free to join) to take maximum advantage of all the offers.</p>
<p>Note that it is already Black Friday 2026 in United Kingdom and Australia so we get to see what&#8217;s being offered as well as what&#8217;s on sale. For those in US and Canada, the sales goes live at 0:00 EST which means there are only a few more hours. We&#8217;ll update the sales list when the sales goes live later tonight.</p>
<p>Don&#8217;t miss out on any future LEGO News &amp; Deals by following us!</p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get LEGO news, new product updates, sales &amp; deals updates, creations and reviews right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates. For those that prefer mobile device real time push notifications for our LEGO Deals &amp; News, we have the <a href="https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VbDxgTZ6BIEptg6nJX0p" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">Whatsapp Channel</a> and <a href="https://discord.com/channels/1399932842276028519/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">Discord Channel</a>.</p>
<h3><span style="text-decoration: underline;">40888 Gozilla Logo &amp; Footprint GWP</span></h3>
<p>You can get a free 18+ LEGO 40888 Godzilla Logo &amp; Footprint GWP Gift Set when you purchase the all-new 18+ LEGO IDEAS 21375 Godzilla set. Promotion runs from November 27 to November 30, 2026 or while supplies last.</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Shop Now &amp; See All Offers at LEGO:</strong> <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">US United States</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK United Kingdom</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a></li>
</ul>
<p><img decoding="async" class=" wp-image-114156 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18-LEGO-40888-Godzilla-Logo-Footprint-GWP-November-2026-Black-Friday-Promo-Gift-with-Purchase-Front-Box.png" alt="" width="783" height="658" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18-LEGO-40888-Godzilla-Logo-Footprint-GWP-November-2026-Black-Friday-Promo-Gift-with-Purchase-Front-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18-LEGO-40888-Godzilla-Logo-Footprint-GWP-November-2026-Black-Friday-Promo-Gift-with-Purchase-Front-Box-300x252.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18-LEGO-40888-Godzilla-Logo-Footprint-GWP-November-2026-Black-Friday-Promo-Gift-with-Purchase-Front-Box-1024x860.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18-LEGO-40888-Godzilla-Logo-Footprint-GWP-November-2026-Black-Friday-Promo-Gift-with-Purchase-Front-Box-768x645.png 768w" sizes="(max-width: 783px) 100vw, 783px" /></p>
<p><img decoding="async" class=" wp-image-114162 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18-LEGO-40888-Godzilla-Logo-Footprint-GWP-November-2026-Black-Friday-Promo-Gift-with-Purchase-Back-Box.png" alt="" width="922" height="773" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18-LEGO-40888-Godzilla-Logo-Footprint-GWP-November-2026-Black-Friday-Promo-Gift-with-Purchase-Back-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18-LEGO-40888-Godzilla-Logo-Footprint-GWP-November-2026-Black-Friday-Promo-Gift-with-Purchase-Back-Box-300x252.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18-LEGO-40888-Godzilla-Logo-Footprint-GWP-November-2026-Black-Friday-Promo-Gift-with-Purchase-Back-Box-1024x858.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18-LEGO-40888-Godzilla-Logo-Footprint-GWP-November-2026-Black-Friday-Promo-Gift-with-Purchase-Back-Box-768x644.png 768w" sizes="(max-width: 922px) 100vw, 922px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-114164 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-IDEAS-21375-Godzilla-November-2026-Black-Friday-Release-Date-Front-Box.png" alt="" width="1007" height="1007" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-IDEAS-21375-Godzilla-November-2026-Black-Friday-Release-Date-Front-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-IDEAS-21375-Godzilla-November-2026-Black-Friday-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x300.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-IDEAS-21375-Godzilla-November-2026-Black-Friday-Release-Date-Front-Box-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-IDEAS-21375-Godzilla-November-2026-Black-Friday-Release-Date-Front-Box-150x150.png 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-IDEAS-21375-Godzilla-November-2026-Black-Friday-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x768.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1007px) 100vw, 1007px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-114177 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-IDEAS-21375-Godzilla-November-2026-Black-Friday-Release-Date-Back-Box.png" alt="" width="918" height="1200" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-IDEAS-21375-Godzilla-November-2026-Black-Friday-Release-Date-Back-Box.png 918w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-IDEAS-21375-Godzilla-November-2026-Black-Friday-Release-Date-Back-Box-230x300.png 230w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-IDEAS-21375-Godzilla-November-2026-Black-Friday-Release-Date-Back-Box-783x1024.png 783w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-IDEAS-21375-Godzilla-November-2026-Black-Friday-Release-Date-Back-Box-768x1004.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 918px) 100vw, 918px" /></p>
<h3><span style="text-decoration: underline;">40914 Retro Jukebox GWP &amp; 40918 Winter Snow Globe GWP</span></h3>
<p>Both LEGO 40918 Winter Snow Globe GWP and LEGO 40914 Retro Jukebox GWP gift sets will be returning back for Black Friday Weekend 2026. These were previously available earlier during Insiders Weekend 2026 (November 21-22, 2026).</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-114892 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-GWP-Promo-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Front-Box.webp" alt="" width="641" height="651" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-GWP-Promo-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Front-Box.webp 1182w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-GWP-Promo-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Front-Box-296x300.webp 296w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-GWP-Promo-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Front-Box-1009x1024.webp 1009w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-GWP-Promo-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Front-Box-768x780.webp 768w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-GWP-Promo-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Front-Box-1024x1040.webp 1024w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 641px) 100vw, 641px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-114894 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-GWP-Promo-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Back-Box.webp" alt="" width="727" height="737" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-GWP-Promo-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Back-Box.webp 1185w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-GWP-Promo-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Back-Box-296x300.webp 296w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-GWP-Promo-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Back-Box-1011x1024.webp 1011w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-GWP-Promo-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Back-Box-768x778.webp 768w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-GWP-Promo-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Back-Box-1024x1037.webp 1024w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 727px) 100vw, 727px" /></p>
<p>LEGO 40918 Winter Snow Globe GWP gift set is free when you spend over $170 USD / $220 CAD / £155 GBP / $275 AUD. LEGO 40914 Retro Jukebox GWP gift set is free when you spend over $250 USD / $325 CAD / £225 GBP / $410 AUD. Promotion runs from November 27-29, 2026 or while supplies last.</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Shop Now &amp; See All Offers at LEGO:</strong> <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">US United States</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK United Kingdom</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a></li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-114881 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40914-Retro-Jukebox-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Promotion-Front-Box.webp" alt="" width="520" height="738" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40914-Retro-Jukebox-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Promotion-Front-Box.webp 846w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40914-Retro-Jukebox-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Promotion-Front-Box-212x300.webp 212w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40914-Retro-Jukebox-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Promotion-Front-Box-722x1024.webp 722w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40914-Retro-Jukebox-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Promotion-Front-Box-768x1089.webp 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 520px) 100vw, 520px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-114890 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40914-Retro-Jukebox-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Promotion-Back-Box.webp" alt="" width="512" height="725" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40914-Retro-Jukebox-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Promotion-Back-Box.webp 847w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40914-Retro-Jukebox-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Promotion-Back-Box-212x300.webp 212w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40914-Retro-Jukebox-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Promotion-Back-Box-723x1024.webp 723w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40914-Retro-Jukebox-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Promotion-Back-Box-768x1088.webp 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 512px) 100vw, 512px" /></p>
<h3><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Insiders Rewards Center for Black Friday 2026</span></h3>
<p>Most of the stuff that were previously from Insiders Weekend is still available at the LEGO Insiders Rewards Center (<a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a>). Though, we&#8217;d like to point out a few key highlights you don&#8217;t want too miss out on. Some gift sets are returning back as they sold out pretty quickly during Insiders Weekend 2026.</p>
<p>From November 27-30, 2026 (or while supplies last), you can get 500 Insiders Reward Points with a redemption of only 100 Insiders Reward Points. This is a great deal and from past years, these similar promotions sell out fast and don&#8217;t usually last through the whole promo period. Note that different countries may have slightly different point thresholds.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-114987 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Black-Friday-2026-Points-Promotion-Offer-Sale-Landing-Page.jpg" alt="" width="1142" height="462" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Black-Friday-2026-Points-Promotion-Offer-Sale-Landing-Page.jpg 1560w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Black-Friday-2026-Points-Promotion-Offer-Sale-Landing-Page-300x121.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Black-Friday-2026-Points-Promotion-Offer-Sale-Landing-Page-1024x414.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Black-Friday-2026-Points-Promotion-Offer-Sale-Landing-Page-768x311.jpg 768w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Black-Friday-2026-Points-Promotion-Offer-Sale-Landing-Page-1536x621.jpg 1536w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1142px) 100vw, 1142px" /></p>
<p>Another item I would like to highlight from the LEGO Insiders Rewards Center (<a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a>) is the 5010881 LEGO Santa&#8217;s Workshop that will be available for 2400 points redemption. This one sold out pretty quickly during Insiders Weekend last week. However, it will be returning back again on Black Friday 2026. Its a pretty cute set and I wouldn&#8217;t want to miss out on this.<img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-115412 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/5010881-LEGO-Santas-Workshop-Insiders-Rewards-Center-Black-Friday-GWP.webp" alt="" width="1200" height="799" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/5010881-LEGO-Santas-Workshop-Insiders-Rewards-Center-Black-Friday-GWP.webp 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/5010881-LEGO-Santas-Workshop-Insiders-Rewards-Center-Black-Friday-GWP-300x200.webp 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/5010881-LEGO-Santas-Workshop-Insiders-Rewards-Center-Black-Friday-GWP-1024x682.webp 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/5010881-LEGO-Santas-Workshop-Insiders-Rewards-Center-Black-Friday-GWP-768x511.webp 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /> <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-115413 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/5010881-LEGO-Santas-Workshop-Insiders-Rewards-Center-Black-Friday-GWP-Lifestyle.webp" alt="" width="1200" height="798" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/5010881-LEGO-Santas-Workshop-Insiders-Rewards-Center-Black-Friday-GWP-Lifestyle.webp 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/5010881-LEGO-Santas-Workshop-Insiders-Rewards-Center-Black-Friday-GWP-Lifestyle-300x200.webp 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/5010881-LEGO-Santas-Workshop-Insiders-Rewards-Center-Black-Friday-GWP-Lifestyle-1024x681.webp 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/5010881-LEGO-Santas-Workshop-Insiders-Rewards-Center-Black-Friday-GWP-Lifestyle-768x511.webp 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></p>
