					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="766" height="415" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GiftCards.com-LEGO-E-Gift-Card-Options-Designs.jpg" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="GiftCards.com LEGO E-Gift Card Options Designs" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GiftCards.com-LEGO-E-Gift-Card-Options-Designs.jpg 766w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GiftCards.com-LEGO-E-Gift-Card-Options-Designs-300x163.jpg 300w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 766px) 100vw, 766px" /></p>
<p>GiftCards US online is a popular website to purchase various Gift Cards in the US. They are now</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/us-black-friday-2026-deal-buy-100-lego-e-gift-card-get-free-10-giftcard-us-online-e-gift-card-november-26-29-2026/">[US] Black Friday 2026 Deal: Buy $100 LEGO E-Gift Card &#038; Get FREE $10 GiftCard US Online E-Gift Card (November 26-29, 2026)</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=44432&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.giftcards.com%2Fus%2Fen" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GiftCards US online</a> is a popular website to purchase various Gift Cards in the US. They are now running a new Black Friday 2026 promotion from November 26-29, 2026.</p>
<p>Right now, they have launched a new promotion where if you spend $100 on <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=44432&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.giftcards.com%2Fus%2Fen%2Fcatalog%2Fproduct-details%2Flego-gift-card" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO E-Gift Card</a>, you&#8217;ll get a FREE $10 <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=44432&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.giftcards.com%2Fus%2Fen" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GiftCards US online</a> Gift Card. Use coupon code <strong>BFBUILD</strong> at checkout. Note that gift cards values <span style="text-decoration: underline;">do not expire</span>.</p>
<p><a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=44432&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.giftcards.com%2Fus%2Fen%2Fcatalog%2Fproduct-details%2Flego-gift-card" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO E-Gift Cards</a> are stackable with LEGO Insider Reward Points, sales and any GWP gift with purchases that the <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">official LEGO Store USA</a> has at the moment.</p>
<h3>LEGO US E-Gift Cards</h3>
<p>Once purchased, these <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=44432&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.giftcards.com%2Fus%2Fen%2Fcatalog%2Fproduct-details%2Flego-gift-card" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO E-Gift Card</a> can be used at the <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">official LEGO Store USA</a>.</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Shop Now:</strong> <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=44432&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.giftcards.com%2Fus%2Fen" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GiftCards US Online</a></li>
</ul>
<p><a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=44432&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.giftcards.com%2Fus%2Fen%2Fcatalog%2Fproduct-details%2Flego-gift-card" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-112434 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GiftCards.com-LEGO-E-Gift-Card-Options-Designs.jpg" alt="" width="766" height="415" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GiftCards.com-LEGO-E-Gift-Card-Options-Designs.jpg 766w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GiftCards.com-LEGO-E-Gift-Card-Options-Designs-300x163.jpg 300w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 766px) 100vw, 766px" /></a></p>
<p><strong>For the latest and most up to date <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=44432&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.giftcards.com%2Fus%2Fen" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GiftCards US online</a> promotions, please <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=44432&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.giftcards.com%2Fus%2Fen%2Fpromotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">visit this page</a>.</strong></p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" data-google-interstitial="false">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get LEGO news, new product updates, sales &amp; deals updates, creations and reviews right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-google-interstitial="false">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates. For those that prefer mobile device real time push notifications for our LEGO Deals &amp; News, we have the <a href="https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VbDxgTZ6BIEptg6nJX0p" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">Whatsapp Channel</a> and <a href="https://discord.com/channels/1399932842276028519/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">Discord Channel</a>.</p>
<p>For the most up to date current LEGO promotions, offers and gift with purchase (GWP) being offered, check the official LEGO store promotional pages links below.</p>
<ul>
<li><a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong>US United States</strong> – LEGO Shop at Home Promotional Offers Page</a></li>
<li><a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong>Canada</strong> – LEGO Shop at Home Promotional Offers Page</a></li>
<li><a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong>UK United Kingdom</strong> – LEGO Shop at Home Promotional Offers Page</a></li>
<li><a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong>Australia</strong> – LEGO Shop at Home Promotional Offers Page</a></li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-103542 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Sales-Deals-Logo-Banner-Discount-Savings.jpg" alt="" width="909" height="459" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Sales-Deals-Logo-Banner-Discount-Savings.jpg 909w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Sales-Deals-Logo-Banner-Discount-Savings-300x151.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Sales-Deals-Logo-Banner-Discount-Savings-768x388.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 909px) 100vw, 909px" /></p>
<p><strong>More LEGO reads at Toys N Bricks:</strong> <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-news/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO News</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-resources/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Resource Guides</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/legoland-resources/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND Resource Guides</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-reviews/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Reviews</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-sales-deals-list-usa/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">US LEGO Deals</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-sales-deals-list-canada/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada LEGO Deals</a></p>
<p><strong>Visit our LEGO Forums:</strong> Where traditional and classic meets our <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/forum" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Legacy LEGO Forums</a>. A library of LEGO resources and for members to ask questions. All articles posted on our main site at Toysnbricks.com are posted in the forums as well. The best part is that there are <span style="text-decoration: underline;">no ads</span> in our LEGO forums. Registration for a basic forum account is free and fast.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-113380 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo.jpg" alt="" width="740" height="591" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo.jpg 999w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo-300x240.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo-768x613.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 740px) 100vw, 740px" /></p>
