					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="1036" height="881" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Amazon-Canada-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-Updated-List-November-25-2026.jpg" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="Amazon Canada LEGO Black Friday Deals 2026 Updated List November 25, 2026" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Amazon-Canada-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-Updated-List-November-25-2026.jpg 1036w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Amazon-Canada-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-Updated-List-November-25-2026-300x255.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Amazon-Canada-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-Updated-List-November-25-2026-1024x871.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Amazon-Canada-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-Updated-List-November-25-2026-768x653.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1036px) 100vw, 1036px" /></p>
<p>Amazon Canada started their LEGO Black Friday 2026 deals earlier last week. They have now upgraded some of</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/amazon-canada-lego-black-friday-deals-2026-continues-discount-increase-more-sets-added-as-of-november-25-2026/">Amazon Canada LEGO Black Friday Deals 2026 Continues with Over 200 Sets: Discount Increase &#038; More Sets Added as of November 25, 2026</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><a href="https://www.amazon.ca/events/blackfriday/8?_encoding=UTF8&amp;pd_rd_w=bPA0U&amp;content-id=amzn1.sym.f543cd77-a484-40c6-a680-51de9519c6da&amp;pf_rd_p=f543cd77-a484-40c6-a680-51de9519c6da&amp;pf_rd_r=R1SX5K2X9AVQNJ5CW6DM&amp;pd_rd_wg=fBOUb&amp;pd_rd_r=fe5aac55-a082-4032-a7e5-9884dc0333d4&amp;discounts-widget=%2522%257B%255C%2522state%255C%2522%253A%257B%255C%2522refinementFilters%255C%2522%253A%257B%255C%2522brands%255C%2522%253A%255B%255C%2522249943%257CLEGO%255C%2522%255D%257D%257D%252C%255C%2522version%255C%2522%253A1%257D%2522&amp;promotionsSearchLastSeenAsin=B0DJ1D4SHM&amp;promotionsSearchStartIndex=90&amp;promotionsSearchPageSize=90&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkId=6f493fe221b4d694802b10f3c24d1330&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-115377 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Amazon-Canada-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-Updated-List-November-25-2026.jpg" alt="" width="1036" height="881" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Amazon-Canada-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-Updated-List-November-25-2026.jpg 1036w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Amazon-Canada-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-Updated-List-November-25-2026-300x255.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Amazon-Canada-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-Updated-List-November-25-2026-1024x871.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Amazon-Canada-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-Updated-List-November-25-2026-768x653.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1036px) 100vw, 1036px" /></a></p>
<p><a href="https://www.amazon.ca/Best-Sellers-Toys-Games-Building-Construction/zgbs/toys/6303772011/ref=zg_bs_nav_toys_1_toys?&amp;_encoding=UTF8&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkCode=ur2&amp;linkId=b2b40c2932de313d6407b37fba062f11&amp;camp=15121&amp;creative=330641" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.amazon.ca/Best-Sellers-Toys-Games-Building-Construction/zgbs/toys/6303772011/ref=zg_bs_nav_toys_1_toys?&amp;_encoding=UTF8&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkCode=ur2&amp;linkId=b2b40c2932de313d6407b37fba062f11&amp;camp=15121&amp;creative=330641">Amazon Canada</a> started their LEGO Black Friday 2026 deals earlier last week. They have now upgraded some of the discount percentages as well as added a few more new sets. There are <a href="https://www.amazon.ca/events/blackfriday/8?_encoding=UTF8&amp;pd_rd_w=bPA0U&amp;content-id=amzn1.sym.f543cd77-a484-40c6-a680-51de9519c6da&amp;pf_rd_p=f543cd77-a484-40c6-a680-51de9519c6da&amp;pf_rd_r=R1SX5K2X9AVQNJ5CW6DM&amp;pd_rd_wg=fBOUb&amp;pd_rd_r=fe5aac55-a082-4032-a7e5-9884dc0333d4&amp;discounts-widget=%2522%257B%255C%2522state%255C%2522%253A%257B%255C%2522refinementFilters%255C%2522%253A%257B%255C%2522brands%255C%2522%253A%255B%255C%2522249943%257CLEGO%255C%2522%255D%257D%257D%252C%255C%2522version%255C%2522%253A1%257D%2522&amp;promotionsSearchLastSeenAsin=B0DJ1D4SHM&amp;promotionsSearchStartIndex=90&amp;promotionsSearchPageSize=90&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkId=6f493fe221b4d694802b10f3c24d1330&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">over 200 LEGO sets discounted for Black Friday 2026 at Amazon Canada</a>.</p>
<p>For example, <a href="https://www.amazon.ca/LEGO-Potter-Diagon-Wizarding-Building/dp/B0DHLHLX1B?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkId=1a5d708d3d9451b05cbe191f14c48189&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">18+ LEGO Harry Potter Diagon Alley Wizarding Shops 76444</a> has now been further reduced to <strong>$184.99</strong> (reg.$259.99). Savings now work out to be 29% off.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-92969 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/18-LEGO-Harry-Potter-76444-Diagon-Alley-Wizarding-Shops-January-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="970" height="855" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/18-LEGO-Harry-Potter-76444-Diagon-Alley-Wizarding-Shops-January-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 970w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/18-LEGO-Harry-Potter-76444-Diagon-Alley-Wizarding-Shops-January-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x264.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/18-LEGO-Harry-Potter-76444-Diagon-Alley-Wizarding-Shops-January-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x677.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 970px) 100vw, 970px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-92971 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/18-LEGO-Harry-Potter-76444-Diagon-Alley-Wizarding-Shops-January-2025-Release-Date-Back-Box.jpg" alt="" width="988" height="874" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/18-LEGO-Harry-Potter-76444-Diagon-Alley-Wizarding-Shops-January-2025-Release-Date-Back-Box.jpg 988w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/18-LEGO-Harry-Potter-76444-Diagon-Alley-Wizarding-Shops-January-2025-Release-Date-Back-Box-300x265.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/18-LEGO-Harry-Potter-76444-Diagon-Alley-Wizarding-Shops-January-2025-Release-Date-Back-Box-768x679.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 988px) 100vw, 988px" /></p>
<p>Be sure to check out the Amazon Black Friday Week 2026 <a href="https://www.amazon.ca/blackfriday?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkId=4cba3bdbf7e130e22b845b636870c50f&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">over here</a>. There are deals in every department (not just LEGO). Prime Membership is <span style="text-decoration: underline;">not required</span> to purchase these sets with Black Friday savings. Free shipping on orders above $35 CAD.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-64402 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/Amazon-Logo-Banner.jpg" alt="" width="545" height="230" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/Amazon-Logo-Banner.jpg 927w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/Amazon-Logo-Banner-300x127.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/Amazon-Logo-Banner-768x324.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 545px) 100vw, 545px" /></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;"><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get LEGO news, new product updates, sales &amp; deals updates, creations and reviews right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates. For those that prefer mobile device real time push notifications for our LEGO Deals &amp; News, we have the <a href="https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VbDxgTZ6BIEptg6nJX0p" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">Whatsapp Channel</a> and <a href="https://discord.com/channels/1399932842276028519/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">Discord Channel</a>.</span></p>
