					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="1475" height="1200" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/18-LEGO-IDEAS-21345-Polaroid-OneStep-SX-70-Camera-January-2024-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="18+ LEGO IDEAS 21345 Polaroid OneStep SX-70 Camera January 2024 Release Date Front Box" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/18-LEGO-IDEAS-21345-Polaroid-OneStep-SX-70-Camera-January-2024-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 1475w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/18-LEGO-IDEAS-21345-Polaroid-OneStep-SX-70-Camera-January-2024-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x244.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/18-LEGO-IDEAS-21345-Polaroid-OneStep-SX-70-Camera-January-2024-Release-Date-Front-Box-1024x833.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/18-LEGO-IDEAS-21345-Polaroid-OneStep-SX-70-Camera-January-2024-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x625.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1475px) 100vw, 1475px" /></p>
<p>Happy Late Wednesday Afternoon Everyone! Amazon US currently has some pretty deals for today. Free shipping on orders</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/8-handpicked-verified-best-amazon-us-lego-deals-sales-list-for-this-late-afternoon-november-25-2026/">8 Handpicked &#038; Verified Best Amazon US LEGO Deals &#038; Sales List for This Late Afternoon, November 25, 2026</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
