										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Happy Late Wednesday Afternoon Everyone! <a href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19">Amazon US</a> currently has some pretty deals for today. Free shipping on orders above $35. As always, Amazon prices can fluctuate at anytime.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-87357 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/18-LEGO-IDEAS-21345-Polaroid-OneStep-SX-70-Camera-January-2024-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="1076" height="875" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/18-LEGO-IDEAS-21345-Polaroid-OneStep-SX-70-Camera-January-2024-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 1475w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/18-LEGO-IDEAS-21345-Polaroid-OneStep-SX-70-Camera-January-2024-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x244.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/18-LEGO-IDEAS-21345-Polaroid-OneStep-SX-70-Camera-January-2024-Release-Date-Front-Box-1024x833.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/18-LEGO-IDEAS-21345-Polaroid-OneStep-SX-70-Camera-January-2024-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x625.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1076px) 100vw, 1076px" /></p>
