					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="1200" height="1200" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Friends-42717-Family-Dollhouse-January-2027-Release-Date-Front-Box.webp" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="LEGO Friends 42717 Family Dollhouse January 2027 Release Date Front Box" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Friends-42717-Family-Dollhouse-January-2027-Release-Date-Front-Box.webp 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Friends-42717-Family-Dollhouse-January-2027-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x300.webp 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Friends-42717-Family-Dollhouse-January-2027-Release-Date-Front-Box-1024x1024.webp 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Friends-42717-Family-Dollhouse-January-2027-Release-Date-Front-Box-150x150.webp 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Friends-42717-Family-Dollhouse-January-2027-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x768.webp 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></p>
<p>Three LEGO Friends January 2027 sets were revealed earlier last month. Now, another new LEGO Friends January 2027</p>
