										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-115339 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Friends-42717-Family-Dollhouse-January-2027-Release-Date-Front-Box.webp" alt="" width="1200" height="1200" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Friends-42717-Family-Dollhouse-January-2027-Release-Date-Front-Box.webp 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Friends-42717-Family-Dollhouse-January-2027-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x300.webp 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Friends-42717-Family-Dollhouse-January-2027-Release-Date-Front-Box-1024x1024.webp 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Friends-42717-Family-Dollhouse-January-2027-Release-Date-Front-Box-150x150.webp 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Friends-42717-Family-Dollhouse-January-2027-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x768.webp 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></p>
<p>Three LEGO Friends January 2027 sets <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/three-lego-friends-january-2027-sets-revealed-us-canada-prices-release-dates-set-images-42709-42718-42719/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">were revealed earlier last month</a>. Now, another new LEGO Friends January 2027 set has been revealed LEGO (<a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a>). We&#8217;ll look at the release dates, US/Canada prices, set images and more in this article.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-113971 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Three-LEGO-Friends-January-2027-Sets-Front-Box-42709-42718-42719-scaled.jpg" alt="" width="1158" height="391" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Three-LEGO-Friends-January-2027-Sets-Front-Box-42709-42718-42719-scaled.jpg 2560w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Three-LEGO-Friends-January-2027-Sets-Front-Box-42709-42718-42719-300x101.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Three-LEGO-Friends-January-2027-Sets-Front-Box-42709-42718-42719-1024x346.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Three-LEGO-Friends-January-2027-Sets-Front-Box-42709-42718-42719-768x259.jpg 768w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Three-LEGO-Friends-January-2027-Sets-Front-Box-42709-42718-42719-1536x518.jpg 1536w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Three-LEGO-Friends-January-2027-Sets-Front-Box-42709-42718-42719-2048x691.jpg 2048w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1158px) 100vw, 1158px" /></p>
<p>Keep it lock to Toys N Bricks and we&#8217;ll let you know when the 42717 Family Dollhouse set becomes available!</p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get LEGO news, new product updates, sales &amp; deals updates, creations and reviews right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates. For those that prefer mobile device real time push notifications for our LEGO Deals &amp; News, we have the <a href="https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VbDxgTZ6BIEptg6nJX0p" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">Whatsapp Channel</a> and <a href="https://discord.com/channels/1399932842276028519/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">Discord Channel</a>.</p>
<ul>
<li>42717 Family Dollhouse</li>
<li><strong>Shop Now at LEGO:</strong> <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a></li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-115349 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Friends-42717-Family-Dollhouse-January-2027-Release-Date-Lifestyle.webp" alt="" width="1200" height="800" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Friends-42717-Family-Dollhouse-January-2027-Release-Date-Lifestyle.webp 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Friends-42717-Family-Dollhouse-January-2027-Release-Date-Lifestyle-300x200.webp 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Friends-42717-Family-Dollhouse-January-2027-Release-Date-Lifestyle-1024x683.webp 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Friends-42717-Family-Dollhouse-January-2027-Release-Date-Lifestyle-768x512.webp 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></p>
<p><!--StartFragment --></p>
<p><!--EndFragment --></p>
<h2><span style="text-decoration: underline;">LEGO Friends 42717 Family Dollhouse January 2027 Set Revealed: Release Dates, US/Canada Prices &amp; Images</span></h2>
<h3>42717 Family Dollhouse January 2027</h3>
<ul>
<li>Retail Price: $39.99 USD / $54.99 CAD / £32.99 GBP / $? AUD</li>
<li>Recommended Age: 5+</li>
<li>Number of Pieces: 212</li>
<li>Official Release Date: January 1, 2027</li>
<li><strong>Shop Now at LEGO:</strong> <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a></li>
</ul>
